# Reports (generated at runtime)
# Keep the CJK font: export.service.ts reads it from REPORTS_DIR to render
# Chinese text in PDFs. Excluding the whole directory shipped images whose
# PDFs silently fell back to a system font that Alpine does not have.
reports/*
!reports/NotoSansCJKsc-Regular.otf

